  "title": "Liz&#39;s Astounding Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "These cookies are moist and full of chocolate, they&#39;re really delicious. You&#39;ll probably want to throw away your old chocolate chip cookie recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Suzie Ellwood"
